{"name": "Roguebound Pirates", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"454\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/9df57ebb94f0479068c288a55331cd46.poster.avif?t=1787215891\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/9df57ebb94f0479068c288a55331cd46.webm?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/9df57ebb94f0479068c288a55331cd46.mp4?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">INVENTORY MECHANICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place an item in your grid-based inventory and it physically appears on your ship! Equip ridiculous weapons, peculiar gadgets, and relics from the depths. As the captain, you have full control over the layout of your vessel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/dceb3cb13d23f007f41b36e216edc0a9.poster.avif?t=1787215891\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/dceb3cb13d23f007f41b36e216edc0a9.webm?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/dceb3cb13d23f007f41b36e216edc0a9.mp4?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UPGRADE &amp; SYNERGIZE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade both your ship and your gear. Different pieces of equipment can also boost each other depending on how you place them in the inventory, allowing you to create incredibly powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"510\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/6d5f5521b965933e7c29ad29eae4e7b2.poster.avif?t=1787215891\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/6d5f5521b965933e7c29ad29eae4e7b2.webm?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/6d5f5521b965933e7c29ad29eae4e7b2.mp4?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NEW RUN, NEW SHIP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on missions with varying objectives, starting gear, and rulesets. Each mission starts fresh and gives you a new opportunity to turn your ship into an overpowered vessel of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"506\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/58168f2d17a22d2a070a17ba61cf223f.poster.avif?t=1787215891\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/58168f2d17a22d2a070a17ba61cf223f.webm?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/58168f2d17a22d2a070a17ba61cf223f.mp4?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BUILD YOUR BASE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Completing missions earns you resources to build your own pirate base, unlocking new equipment, gameplay features, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"574\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/50d9b35da8e927589c5dcb953bf55531.poster.avif?t=1787215891\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/50d9b35da8e927589c5dcb953bf55531.webm?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/50d9b35da8e927589c5dcb953bf55531.mp4?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DESIGN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draw your own unique pirate emblem to make your enemies quiver in fear! You can even import existing images from your computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/5b4afba58da236fffd50650c4dfb4e09.poster.avif?t=1787215891\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/5b4afba58da236fffd50650c4dfb4e09.webm?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/5b4afba58da236fffd50650c4dfb4e09.mp4?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">REPLAYABILITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a wide variety of objectives, game-changing rulesets, multiple difficulties, a massive arsenal of equipment, diverse upgrades, and powerful specialties, <i>Roguebound Pirates</i>\u00a0is designed to be highly replayable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/7ea0970300f9fbf6f4bdce243365e0b6.poster.avif?t=1787215891\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/7ea0970300f9fbf6f4bdce243365e0b6.webm?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/7ea0970300f9fbf6f4bdce243365e0b6.mp4?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The game is in active development. <strong>Wishlist now</strong> and join the\u00a0<strong>Discord</strong>\u00a0to share ideas!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"472\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/19f2cb35a81aa1651e520e24ffd457d1.poster.avif?t=1787215891\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/19f2cb35a81aa1651e520e24ffd457d1.webm?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/extras/19f2cb35a81aa1651e520e24ffd457d1.mp4?t=1787215891\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Loot, upgrade & dominate! Your inventory IS your ship in this action roguelike. Customize weapons, create game-breaking synergies, and claim your place as the most overpowered pirate across the seas!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327000/8c7333c1c20612b6dc11e141a083acbad81ea434/header.jpg?t=1787215891", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Inventory Management", "Gun Customization", "Naval Combat", "Pirates", "Roguelite"], "developers": "Redbeak Games", "publishers": "Redbeak Games", "release_date": "Q4 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3327000", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "14 April 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/KTyFM1Tw2JY", "first_seen": 1776117600.0, "review_rank": 870}